{"ref":"BDB, חֹל²","hw":"חֹל²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹל</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>profaneness, commonness</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם חֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.5\">1 S 21:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ חֹל</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.6\">6</a>; in concrete sense, opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹדֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.10\">Lv 10:10</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.26\">Ez 22:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.20\">42:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.23\">44:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.15\">48:15</a>.","next":"BDB, חָלָל²","prev":"BDB, חָלַל³"}